flowchart TD
  DEV[Developer commit feature branch] --> PR[Pull Request to main]
  PR --> BUILD[GitHub Actions build dotnet 8 and npm ci]
  BUILD --> UT[Unit Tests xUnit and Vitest coverage gate 80 percent]
  UT --> SCAN[CodeQL SAST and dependency scan]
  SCAN --> ART[Publish artifacts container images to Azure Container Registry]
  ART --> DEVENV[Deploy to DEV automatic]
  DEVENV --> IT[Integration and API tests]
  IT --> QAENV[Deploy to QA manual approval]
  QAENV --> PERF[Performance tests p95 under 500 ms]
  PERF --> PRODENV[Deploy to PROD blue green approval by Release Manager]
  PRODENV --> MON[Application Insights alerts and rollback to previous slot]